sequenceDiagram
    actor HR
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)

    Note over HR,DB: Add a person to a vacancy's standing interviewer pool
    HR->>FE: Select a vacancy, pick a user to add
    FE->>BE: POST /api/vacancies/:id/interviewers {userId}
    BE->>DB: findUnique User by id
    alt target user's role is not INTERVIEWER or MANAGEMENT
        BE-->>FE: 400 "userId must belong to an Interviewer or Management user"
    else valid role
        BE->>DB: Create VacancyInterviewer {vacancyId, userId}
        alt already assigned to this vacancy
            BE-->>FE: 409 "This user is already assigned to this vacancy"
        else newly assigned
            BE->>DB: notifyUser(userId, "vacancy_interviewer_assigned")
            BE-->>FE: 201 created assignment
        end
    end

    Note over HR,DB: Remove a person from the pool
    HR->>FE: Click remove next to a listed interviewer
    FE->>BE: DELETE /api/vacancies/:id/interviewers/:userId
    BE->>DB: Delete VacancyInterviewer {vacancyId, userId}
    alt no such assignment exists
        BE-->>FE: 404 "This user is not assigned to this vacancy"
    else removed
        BE-->>FE: 204 No Content
    end
